<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure — Indian Keto"
  description="Indian Keto participates in affiliate programs including Amazon Associates. Learn how we earn commissions and how it supports our work."
>
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-semibold text-primary mb-6">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <div class="prose-keto">
        <p>Indian Keto is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</p>
        <p>This means that when you click on certain links on our site and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission at no additional cost to you.</p>
        <h2>Why We Use Affiliate Links</h2>
        <p>Affiliate commissions help support the ongoing work of Indian Keto — recipe development, content creation, and site maintenance. We only recommend products we genuinely believe in and that we think will help you with your Indian keto cooking.</p>
        <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We never let affiliate relationships influence our recommendations.</li>
          <li>We clearly mark all affiliate links.</li>
          <li>We only recommend products we would use ourselves.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@indianketo.com">hello@indianketo.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
